title: "R(B4,B7)=22, R(B4,B9)=27 and the Ahmed–Schaal Conjecture 2 — papers, Lean 4 formalizations, SAT certificates"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yong
    given-names: Jerry
    email: jerryjyong@gmail.com
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Ramsey numbers
  - book Ramsey numbers
  - Schur numbers
  - computer-assisted proof
  - SAT
  - LRAT
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  Computer-assisted proofs of R(B4,B7)=22 and R(B4,B9)=27 via
  degree-stratified cube partitions with independently verifiable binary-LRAT
  certificates, and of four families of the Ahmed–Schaal Conjecture 2 via a
  symbolic SAT encoding. Includes papers, Lean 4 formalizations, encoders,
  and verification tooling.
